1
00:00:00,113 --> 00:00:01,207
Di negeri ini,

2
00:00:01,227 --> 00:00:02,307
kejahatan terbesar tidak

3
00:00:02,327 --> 00:00:03,715
terjadi di medan perang,

4
00:00:03,735 --> 00:00:05,526
tapi di atas timbangan pasar,

5
00:00:05,546 --> 00:00:06,870
sedikit demi sedikit,

6
00:00:06,890 --> 00:00:07,851
setiap hari.

7
00:00:07,871 --> 00:00:09,167
Penduduk Madyan hidup makmur

8
00:00:09,187 --> 00:00:10,576
dan ramai berdagang.

9
00:00:10,596 --> 00:00:11,953
Nabi Syu'aib diutus kepada

10
00:00:11,973 --> 00:00:13,139
mereka dengan pesan:

11
00:00:13,159 --> 00:00:14,362
sembahlah Allah,

12
00:00:14,382 --> 00:00:15,832
dan jangan kurangi takaran dan

13
00:00:15,852 --> 00:00:16,562
timbangan.

14
00:00:16,582 --> 00:00:17,553
Penuhilah takaran dan

15
00:00:17,573 --> 00:00:19,257
timbangan dengan adil.

16
00:00:19,277 --> 00:00:20,697
Jangan rugikan hak orang lain.

17
00:00:20,717 --> 00:00:22,199
Sisa yang halal dari Allah

18
00:00:22,219 --> 00:00:23,189
lebih baik bagimu.

19
00:00:23,209 --> 00:00:24,273
Itu surah Hud ayat delapan

20
00:00:24,293 --> 00:00:25,171
puluh lima dan delapan puluh

21
00:00:25,191 --> 00:00:26,060
enam.

22
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,354
Jawab mereka:

23
00:00:27,374 --> 00:00:29,397
apakah agamamu melarang kami

24
00:00:29,417 --> 00:00:31,197
mengelola harta sesuka kami?

25
00:00:31,217 --> 00:00:32,226
Bagi mereka,

26
00:00:32,246 --> 00:00:33,464
curang di timbangan adalah

27
00:00:33,484 --> 00:00:34,362
urusan pribadi,

28
00:00:34,382 --> 00:00:35,783
bukan urusan agama.

29
00:00:35,803 --> 00:00:37,322
Mereka bahkan mengancam:

30
00:00:37,342 --> 00:00:39,040
kalau bukan karena keluargamu,

31
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:40,405
kami sudah merajammu.

32
00:00:40,425 --> 00:00:41,454
Syu'aib menjawab:

33
00:00:41,474 --> 00:00:42,553
apakah keluargaku lebih

34
00:00:42,573 --> 00:00:43,730
terhormat bagimu daripada

35
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:44,152
Allah?

36
00:00:44,172 --> 00:00:45,592
Syu'aib menutup dengan tenang:

37
00:00:45,612 --> 00:00:46,459
berbuatlah menurut

38
00:00:46,479 --> 00:00:48,115
kemampuanmu, dan tunggulah.

39
00:00:48,135 --> 00:00:49,462
Saat keputusan datang,

40
00:00:49,482 --> 00:00:50,685
Syu'aib dan orang-orang

41
00:00:50,705 --> 00:00:52,301
beriman diselamatkan.

42
00:00:52,321 --> 00:00:53,586
Yang zalim dibinasakan oleh

43
00:00:53,606 --> 00:00:54,855
suara yang mengguntur,

44
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:56,109
seolah mereka tidak pernah

45
00:00:56,129 --> 00:00:56,997
tinggal di sana.

46
00:00:57,017 --> 00:00:58,516
Pesan yang sama diulang di

47
00:00:58,536 --> 00:01:00,528
surah Al-Muthaffifin:

48
00:01:00,548 --> 00:01:02,386
celakalah orang-orang yang

49
00:01:02,406 --> 00:01:03,472
curang.

50
00:01:03,492 --> 00:01:04,618
Minta dicukupkan saat

51
00:01:04,638 --> 00:01:06,908
menerima, tapi mengurangi saat

52
00:01:06,928 --> 00:01:09,038
menakar untuk orang lain.

53
00:01:09,058 --> 00:01:10,416
Timbangan yang jujur adalah

54
00:01:10,436 --> 00:01:11,250
ibadah.

55
00:01:11,270 --> 00:01:12,794
Di pekerjaanmu,

56
00:01:12,814 --> 00:01:14,311
timbangan apa yang harus kamu

57
00:01:14,331 --> 00:01:15,030
jaga?

58
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,501
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

59
00:01:16,521 --> 00:01:17,788
bersama AUDIRA.

